3. Correlation of intra-tumoral T-cell populations and non-T-cell populations with ORR rates, 2-Y PFS and 2-Y OS.
4. Identifying specific relapse patterns, with the hypothesis that alterations in tumor genes facilitating immune evasion are enriched in clones emerging at relapse (i.e., secondary resistance).
5. Correlation between target antigen surface level (i.e. CD20) with ORR rates, 2-Y PFS and 2-Y OS.

